30:09.420 --> 30:17.780
According to our test, it takes only a few hours to try all possible pattern calls.

30:17.780 --> 30:22.980
Combined with the vulnerability in gatekeep translate, we can unlock the phone and reach

30:22.980 --> 30:27.920
the sensitive data.

30:27.920 --> 30:35.080
In conclusion, even if the data is stored in the secure world, it still doesn't mean

30:35.080 --> 30:45.080
